/T ("To maximize productivity, start by setting clear, achievable goals. Break down your goals into daily tasks and use a digital tool or planner to track your progress. Implement the Pomodoro Technique: work for 25 minutes, then take a 5-minute break. Avoid multitasking, as it can reduce the quality of your work and lead to burnout. Stay hydrated and ensure you get 7-9 hours of sleep each night.")
